<tr><td data-help-static-en="Click the card / View posts" data-help-static-es="Hacer clic en la tarjeta / Ver publicaciones">Click the card / View posts</td><td><span class="en">Expands the selected Sales employee.</span><span class="es">Expande al empleado de Ventas seleccionado.</span><span class="zh">展开该 Sales 员工。</span><span class="zh-tw">展開該 Sales 員工。</span></td><td><span class="en">Loads the employee's posts, chart and Daily Review for the selected period.</span><span class="es">Carga las publicaciones, el gráfico y Daily Review del empleado para el periodo seleccionado.</span><span class="zh">加载该员工在选定周期的 Post、图表和 Daily Review。</span><span class="zh-tw">載入該員工在選定週期的 Post、圖表和 Daily Review。</span></td></tr>
