</tbody></table></div></section><section class="section" id="salesreview"><h2><span class="en">Daily Review: employee performance review</span><span class="es">Daily Review: revisión de rendimiento del empleado</span><span class="zh">Daily Review：员工表现评价</span><span class="zh-tw">Daily Review：員工表現評價</span></h2><p class="en">Daily Review rates the employee, not an individual post. It is stored separately from Good/Bad Post Review.</p><p class="es">Daily Review evalúa al empleado, no una publicación individual. Se guarda por separado de Good/Bad Post Review.</p><p class="zh">Daily Review 评价的是员工，而不是某一条 Post；它与 Good/Bad Post Review 分开保存。</p><p class="zh-tw">Daily Review 評價的是員工，而不是某一條 Post；它與 Good/Bad Post Review 分開儲存。</p>
<div class="numbered"><div><p class="en">Expand a Sales card and open <b data-help-static-en="Daily Review" data-help-static-es="Daily Review">Daily Review</b> / <b data-help-static-en="Daily Review" data-help-static-es="Daily Review">Daily Review</b>.</p><p class="es">Expande una tarjeta de Ventas y abre Daily Review.</p><p class="zh">展开 Sales 卡并打开 <b data-help-static-en="Daily Review" data-help-static-es="Daily Review">Daily Review</b>。</p><p class="zh-tw">展開 Sales 卡並打開 <b data-help-static-en="Daily Review" data-help-static-es="Daily Review">Daily Review</b>。</p></div><div><p class="en">Choose <b>1–5 stars</b>. Rating is required.</p><p class="es">Elige 1–5 estrellas. La calificación es obligatoria.</p><p class="zh">选择 <b>1–5 星</b>，Rating 必填。</p><p class="zh-tw">選擇 <b>1–5 星</b>，Rating 必填。</p></div><div><p class="en">Enter the <b>Sales / Behavior Review</b> note. Rich text is supported by the review editor.</p><p class="es">Introduce la nota de Sales / Behavior Review. El editor admite texto enriquecido.</p><p class="zh">填写 <b>Sales / Behavior Review</b>，可使用 Review Editor 的格式功能。</p><p class="zh-tw">填寫 <b>Sales / Behavior Review</b>，可使用 Review Editor 的格式功能。</p></div><div><p class="en">Optionally attach JPG/PNG/WebP images.</p><p class="es">Opcionalmente adjunta imágenes JPG/PNG/WebP.</p><p class="zh">可选上传 JPG/PNG/WebP 图片附件。</p><p class="zh-tw">可選上傳 JPG/PNG/WebP 圖片附件。</p></div><div><p class="en">Save Review. Saving creates/updates review history; identical content without new attachments is not duplicated unnecessarily.</p><p class="es">Guardar revisión crea/actualiza el historial; no duplica innecesariamente contenido idéntico sin adjuntos nuevos.</p><p class="zh">点击 Save Review；系统维护 Review History，相同内容且没有新附件时不会无意义重复制造历史记录。</p><p class="zh-tw">點擊 Save Review；系統維護 Review History，相同內容且沒有新附件時不會無意義重復製造歷史記錄。</p></div></div>
<div class="callout warn"><span class="en"><b>Custom date range:</b> a Custom range does not have one single Daily Review because it may span an arbitrary period.</span><span class="es">Rango de fecha personalizado: un rango Custom no tiene una única Daily Review porque puede abarcar un periodo arbitrario.</span><span class="zh"><b>Custom 日期范围：</b>任意 Custom range 不对应一个单一 Daily Review，因此不能直接给整个任意范围保存一条 Daily Review。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Custom 日期範圍：</b>任意 Custom range 不對應一個單一 Daily Review，因此不能直接給整個任意範圍儲存一條 Daily Review。</span></div>
<div class="callout"><span class="en"><b>Review History</b> lets you see saved review versions. The deleted-review switch appears when deleted history exists.</span><span class="es">Review History permite ver versiones guardadas de la revisión. El interruptor de revisiones eliminadas aparece cuando existe historial eliminado.</span><span class="zh"><b>Review History</b> 用于查看历史保存版本；存在删除历史时会出现 See deleted reviews 开关。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Review History</b> 用於查看歷史儲存版本；存在刪除歷史時會出現 See deleted reviews 開關。</span></div></section><section class="section" id="daily-current"><h2><span class="en">Daily Review, completion, chart and Post Search</span><span class="es">Daily Review, finalización, gráfico y búsqueda de publicaciones</span><span class="zh">Daily Review、完成状态、图表与 Post Search</span><span class="zh-tw">Daily Review、完成狀態、圖表與 Post Search</span></h2>
<div class="cards"><div class="card"><h4>Daily Review</h4><p class="en">Daily Review is available for historical dates, not only today. Open Daily Review, then click the date under the Sales name to open the shared Daily Activity Calendar. Blue means Reviewed and green means Complete; one day can show both.</p><p class="es">Daily Review está disponible para fechas históricas, no solo hoy. Ábrelo y haz clic en la fecha bajo el nombre de Ventas para abrir el calendario Daily Activity compartido. Azul = Reviewed y verde = Complete; un día puede mostrar ambos.</p><p class="zh">Daily Review 不限今天，历史日期也可以补写或修改。打开 Daily Review 后，点击 Sales 名字下面的日期进入共用的 Daily Activity Calendar。蓝点表示 Reviewed，绿点表示 Complete，同一天可以同时显示两种状态。</p><p class="zh-tw">Daily Review 不限今天，歷史日期也可以補寫或修改。打開 Daily Review 後，點擊 Sales 名字下面的日期進入共用的 Daily Activity Calendar。藍點表示 Reviewed，綠點表示 Complete，同一天可以同時顯示兩種狀態。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Complete / Incomplete</h4><p class="en">Incomplete is gray and Complete is green. Admin may manually toggle an unfinished day. Once the real post count reaches that day’s actual Daily target, the day is automatically Complete and cannot be changed back to Incomplete. Target met also appears for a manual Complete.</p><p class="es">Incomplete es gris y Complete es verde. Admin puede cambiar manualmente un día aún no cumplido. Cuando el número real de publicaciones alcanza el Daily target real del día, pasa automáticamente a Complete y ya no puede volver a Incomplete. Target met también aparece cuando Admin marca Complete manualmente.</p><p class="zh">Incomplete 为灰色，Complete 为绿色。未真实达标时 Admin 可以手动切换；一旦实际 Post 数量达到当天真实 Daily target，系统自动锁定为 Complete，不能再改回 Incomplete。Admin 手动 Complete 后也会显示 Target met。</p><p class="zh-tw">Incomplete 為灰色，Complete 為綠色。未真實達標時 Admin 可以手動切換；一旦實際 Post 數量達到當天真實 Daily target，系統自動鎖定為 Complete，不能再改回 Incomplete。Admin 手動 Complete 後也會顯示 Target met。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Posting Activity chart</h4><p class="en">Posts and Daily target use the left axis. Its maximum is max(highest Daily target × 120%, highest post count + 1). Daily target lines stay at their real historical values. Daily Review ratings use a separate 1–5 star right axis and are drawn as points connected by a line only on dates that actually have a review.</p><p class="es">Posts y Daily target usan el eje izquierdo. Su máximo es max(Daily target más alto × 120%, mayor número de publicaciones + 1). Las líneas de Daily target permanecen en sus valores históricos reales. Los ratings de Daily Review usan un eje derecho separado de 1–5 estrellas y se dibujan como puntos unidos por una línea solo en fechas con review real.</p><p class="zh">Post 和 Daily target 使用左轴，最高点固定按 max（范围内最高 Daily target × 120%，范围内最高 Post 数量 + 1）计算；Daily target 线按每天真实历史值绘制。Daily Review Rating 单独使用右侧 1–5 星坐标，只在实际有 Review 的日期画点并按日期连线。</p><p class="zh-tw">Post 和 Daily target 使用左軸，最高點固定按 max（範圍內最高 Daily target × 120%，範圍內最高 Post 數量 + 1）計算；Daily target 線按每天真實歷史值繪製。Daily Review Rating 單獨使用右側 1–5 星座標，只在實際有 Review 的日期畫點並按日期連線。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Sales / Post Search</h4><p class="en">Sales Search also searches saved original-post information: Facebook, OfferUp or Craigslist URL, listing/post ID, platform, title and account information. Exact post results identify the Sales owner and open only the matched post instead of expanding every post for that Sales user.</p><p class="es">Sales Search también busca información guardada del post original: URL de Facebook, OfferUp o Craigslist, ID de listing/post, plataforma, título e información de cuenta. Un resultado exacto identifica al vendedor y abre solo la publicación coincidente.</p><p class="zh">Sales Search 除姓名和 Sales ID 外，还能搜索已保存的原帖信息，包括 Facebook / OfferUp / Craigslist 链接、Listing/Post ID、平台、标题和账号信息。Exact Post 搜索结果会显示属于哪个 Sales，点开后只显示命中的那一条 Post，不会把这个 Sales 的全部 Post 一起展开。</p><p class="zh-tw">Sales Search 除姓名和 Sales ID 外，還能搜尋已儲存的原帖資訊，包括 Facebook / OfferUp / Craigslist 連結、Listing/Post ID、平台、標題和帳號資訊。Exact Post 搜尋結果會顯示屬於哪個 Sales，點開後只顯示命中的那一條 Post，不會把這個 Sales 的全部 Post 一起展開。</p></div></div></section><section class="section" id="postreview"><h2><span class="en">Post Review: review one post</span><span class="es">Post Review: revisar una publicación</span><span class="zh">Post Review：审核单条 Post</span><span class="zh-tw">Post Review：審核單條 Post</span></h2><div class="numbered"><div><p class="en">Expand a Sales card, then click the post you want to review.</p><p class="es">Expande una tarjeta de Ventas y haz clic en la publicación que quieres revisar.</p><p class="zh">展开 Sales 卡，点击需要审核的 Post。</p><p class="zh-tw">展開 Sales 卡，點擊需要審核的 Post。</p></div><div><p class="en">Review the saved/fetched listing content and use <b>Open Original</b> when you need to see the live Marketplace page.</p><p class="es">Revisa el contenido guardado/obtenido del anuncio y usa Open Original cuando necesites ver la página de Marketplace en vivo.</p><p class="zh">检查已保存/抓取的 Listing 内容；需要看实时原帖时点 <b>Open Original</b>。</p><p class="zh-tw">檢查已儲存/抓取的 Listing 內容；需要看實時原帖時點 <b>Open Original</b>。</p></div><div><p class="en">Use <b data-help-static-en="Refresh Content" data-help-static-es="Actualizar contenido">Refresh Content</b> when the Marketplace listing has changed. This re-fetches current source content and updates the stored title, description and first available image.</p><p class="es">Usa Refresh Content cuando el anuncio de Marketplace haya cambiado. Vuelve a obtener el contenido actual y actualiza título, descripción y primera imagen disponible guardados.</p><p class="zh">如果 Marketplace 原帖已修改，点 <b data-help-static-en="Refresh Content" data-help-static-es="Actualizar contenido">Refresh Content</b>。系统会重新抓取并更新保存的 title、description 和第一张可用图片。</p><p class="zh-tw">如果 Marketplace 原帖已修改，點 <b data-help-static-en="Refresh Content" data-help-static-es="Actualizar contenido">Refresh Content</b>。系統會重新抓取並更新儲存的 title、description 和第一張可用圖片。</p></div><div><p class="en">Choose <b data-help-static-en="Good" data-help-static-es="Good">Good</b> or <b data-help-static-en="Bad" data-help-static-es="Bad">Bad</b>. A decision is required before Save Review.</p><p class="es">Elige Good o Bad. Se requiere una decisión antes de Save Review.</p><p class="zh">选择 <b data-help-static-en="Good" data-help-static-es="Good">Good</b> 或 <b data-help-static-en="Bad" data-help-static-es="Bad">Bad</b>，保存前必须做 Decision。</p><p class="zh-tw">選擇 <b data-help-static-en="Good" data-help-static-es="Good">Good</b> 或 <b data-help-static-en="Bad" data-help-static-es="Bad">Bad</b>，儲存前必須做 Decision。</p></div><div><p class="en">Add notes and optional images. Notes are tracked in History and may be edited/deleted through the review UI.</p><p class="es">Añade notas e imágenes opcionales. Las notas se registran en History y pueden editarse/eliminarse desde la interfaz de revisión.</p><p class="zh">可添加 Note 和图片；Note 会进入 History，并可通过 Review UI 编辑/删除。</p><p class="zh-tw">可添加 Note 和圖片；Note 會進入 History，並可通過 Review UI 編輯/刪除。</p></div><div><p class="en">Click <b data-help-static-en="Save Review" data-help-static-es="Guardar revisión">Save Review</b>. The post's Good/Bad status immediately becomes part of dashboard/report metrics.</p><p class="es">Haz clic en Save Review. El estado Good/Bad de la publicación pasa inmediatamente a las métricas del Panel/informe.</p><p class="zh">点击 <b data-help-static-en="Save Review" data-help-static-es="Guardar revisión">Save Review</b>，Good/Bad 会进入 Dashboard 和 Report 统计。</p><p class="zh-tw">點擊 <b data-help-static-en="Save Review" data-help-static-es="Guardar revisión">Save Review</b>，Good/Bad 會進入 Dashboard 和 Report 統計。</p></div></div>
<div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th data-help-static-en="Button" data-help-static-es="Botón">Button</th><th data-help-static-en="Effect" data-help-static-es="Efecto">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-help-static-en="Refresh Content" data-help-static-es="Actualizar contenido">Refresh Content</td><td><span class="en">Fetches the newest source content using the configured provider chain/live source.</span><span class="es">Obtiene el contenido más reciente usando la cadena de proveedores configurada/fuente en vivo.</span><span class="zh">通过当前 Provider Chain / live source 重新抓取最新内容。</span><span class="zh-tw">通過目前 Provider Chain / live source 重新抓取最新內容。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Add Note" data-help-static-es="Añadir nota">Add Note</td><td><span class="en">Adds a review-history note; selected images are saved with that note.</span><span class="es">Añade una nota al historial de revisión; las imágenes seleccionadas se guardan con esa nota.</span><span class="zh">新增 Review History Note，选中的图片与 Note 一起保存。</span><span class="zh-tw">新增 Review History Note，選中的圖片與 Note 一起儲存。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Save Review" data-help-static-es="Guardar revisión">Save Review</td><td><span class="en">Saves required Good/Bad decision and current review state.</span><span class="es">Guarda la decisión Good/Bad obligatoria y el estado de revisión actual.</span><span class="zh">保存 Good/Bad Decision 和当前审核状态。</span><span class="zh-tw">儲存 Good/Bad Decision 和目前審核狀態。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Delete Post" data-help-static-es="Eliminar publicación">Delete Post</td><td><span class="en">Permanently hard-deletes the post. See deletion section before using it.</span><span class="es">Elimina permanentemente la publicación. Consulta la sección de eliminación antes de usarlo.</span><span class="zh">永久删除 Post；操作前请先看删除章节。</span><span class="zh-tw">永久刪除 Post；操作前請先看刪除章節。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="section" id="delete"><h2><span class="en">Deletion workflow and Information Center</span><span class="es">Flujo de eliminación y Centro de información</span><span class="zh">删除流程与 Information Center</span><span class="zh-tw">刪除流程與 Information Center</span></h2><div class="callout danger"><span class="en"><b>Admin deletion is permanent.</b> Approving a Sales delete request or using Delete Post removes the post and its dependent post-level records so it no longer participates in duplicate checks/searches.</span><span class="es">La eliminación de Admin es permanente. Aprobar una solicitud de eliminación de Ventas o usar Delete Post elimina la publicación y sus registros dependientes, por lo que deja de participar en comprobaciones de duplicados/búsquedas.</span><span class="zh"><b>Admin 删除是永久删除。</b>批准 Sales 删除申请或直接使用 Delete Post 后，会删除 Post 及相关 Post-level 记录，该内容以后也不会继续干扰查重或搜索。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Admin 刪除是永久刪除。</b>批準 Sales 刪除申請或直接使用 Delete Post 後，會刪除 Post 及相關 Post-level 記錄，該內容以後也不會繼續干擾重複檢查或搜索。</span></div>
<h3><span class="en">When Sales requests deletion</span><span class="es">Cuando Ventas solicita eliminación</span><span class="zh">Sales 提交删除申请以后</span><span class="zh-tw">Sales 提交刪除申請以後</span></h3><div class="numbered"><div><p class="en">The bell badge in <b>Information Center</b> increases.</p><p class="es">Aumenta el badge de la campana en Information Center.</p><p class="zh">顶部 <b>Information Center</b> 铃铛 Badge 数量增加。</p><p class="zh-tw">頂部 <b>Information Center</b> 鈴鐺 Badge 數量增加。</p></div><div><p class="en">Click the notification / <b>Open post →</b>.</p><p class="es">Haz clic en la notificación / Open post →.</p><p class="zh">点击通知或 <b>Open post →</b>。</p><p class="zh-tw">點擊通知或 <b>Open post →</b>。</p></div><div><p class="en">Review Sales name, platform, published date, Post ID, title, description, photos, original URL and the Sales reason.</p><p class="es">Revisa nombre de Ventas, plataforma, fecha de publicación, ID de publicación, título, descripción, fotos, URL original y motivo de Ventas.</p><p class="zh">检查 Sales、Platform、Published、Post ID、Title、Description、Photos、Original URL 和 Sales 的删除原因。</p><p class="zh-tw">檢查 Sales、Platform、Published、Post ID、Title、Description、Photos、Original URL 和 Sales 的刪除原因。</p></div><div><p class="en">Click <b>Reject</b> to keep the post, or <b>Approve &amp; Delete</b> to permanently delete it.</p><p class="es">Haz clic en Reject para conservar la publicación, o en Approve &amp; Delete para eliminarla permanentemente.</p><p class="zh">点 <b>Reject</b> 保留 Post；点 <b>Approve &amp; Delete</b> 永久删除。</p><p class="zh-tw">點 <b>Reject</b> 保留 Post；點 <b>Approve &amp; Delete</b> 永久刪除。</p></div></div>
<h3><span class="en">Direct Admin delete</span><span class="es">Eliminación directa de Admin</span><span class="zh">Admin 直接删除</span><span class="zh-tw">Admin 直接刪除</span></h3><p class="en">Admin can also open Post Review and click <b data-help-static-en="Delete Post" data-help-static-es="Eliminar publicación">Delete Post</b> without waiting for a Sales request. Use this only when the record truly must be removed.</p><p class="es">Admin también puede abrir Post Review y hacer clic en Delete Post sin esperar una solicitud de Ventas. Úsalo solo cuando el registro realmente deba eliminarse.</p><p class="zh">Admin 也可以在 Post Review 里直接点击 <b data-help-static-en="Delete Post" data-help-static-es="Eliminar publicación">Delete Post</b>，无需等待 Sales 申请。只有确认记录确实需要移除时才使用。</p><p class="zh-tw">Admin 也可以在 Post Review 裡直接點擊 <b data-help-static-en="Delete Post" data-help-static-es="Eliminar publicación">Delete Post</b>，無需等待 Sales 申請。只有確認記錄確實需要移除時才使用。</p></section><section class="section" id="reports"><h2><span class="en">Management Reports and CSV tracking</span><span class="es">Informes de gestión y seguimiento CSV</span><span class="zh">Management Reports 与 CSV Tracking</span><span class="zh-tw">Management Reports 與 CSV Tracking</span></h2><p class="en">Open <b data-help-static-en="Reports" data-help-static-es="Informes">Reports</b> from the top navigation. The report is one row per Sales person per day.</p><p class="es">Abre Reports desde la navegación superior. El informe muestra una fila por vendedor y por día.</p><p class="zh">顶部进入 <b data-help-static-en="Reports" data-help-static-es="Informes">Reports</b>。报表按“每个 Sales / 每天一行”显示。</p><p class="zh-tw">頂部進入 <b data-help-static-en="Reports" data-help-static-es="Informes">Reports</b>。報表按“每個 Sales / 每天一行”顯示。</p>
<div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th data-help-static-en="Control / Column" data-help-static-es="Control / columna">Control / Column</th><th data-help-static-en="Meaning" data-help-static-es="Significado">Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Range: 1 Day / 3 Days / Weekly / Monthly / Custom" data-help-static-es="Rango: 1 Día / 3 Días / Semanal / Mensual / Personalizado">Range: 1 Day / 3 Days / Weekly / Monthly / Custom</td><td><span class="en">Controls the report date range.</span><span class="es">Controla el rango de fechas del informe.</span><span class="zh">控制报表日期范围。</span><span class="zh-tw">控製報表日期範圍。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="From / To" data-help-static-es="Desde / Hasta">From / To</td><td><span class="en">Manual range endpoints.</span><span class="es">Extremos manuales del rango.</span><span class="zh">手工日期范围。</span><span class="zh-tw">手工日期範圍。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Sales" data-help-static-es="Ventas">Sales</td><td><span class="en">Choose All or one Sales employee.</span><span class="es">Elige All o un empleado de Ventas.</span><span class="zh">选择 All 或单个 Sales。</span><span class="zh-tw">選擇 All 或單個 Sales。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Download CSV" data-help-static-es="Descargar CSV">Download CSV</td><td><span class="en">Downloads the currently selected period/Sales report.</span><span class="es">Descarga el informe del periodo/vendedor seleccionado actualmente.</span><span class="zh">下载当前筛选条件对应的 CSV。</span><span class="zh-tw">下載目前篩選條件對應的 CSV。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Total / Facebook / OfferUp / Craigslist" data-help-static-es="Total / Facebook / OfferUp / Craigslist">Total / Facebook / OfferUp / Craigslist</td><td><span class="en">Posting volume by day/platform.</span><span class="es">Volumen de publicaciones por día/plataforma.</span><span class="zh">每日总量及各平台数量。</span><span class="zh-tw">每日總量及各平臺數量。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Good / Bad / Good %" data-help-static-es="Good / Bad / Good %">Good / Bad / Good %</td><td><span class="en">Post Review metrics. Good % = Good ÷ (Good + Bad), not total posts.</span><span class="es">Métricas de Post Review. Good % = Good ÷ (Good + Bad), no sobre el total de publicaciones.</span><span class="zh">Post Review 指标。Good % = Good ÷ (Good + Bad)，不是除以 Total。</span><span class="zh-tw">Post Review 指標。Good % = Good ÷ (Good + Bad)，不是除以 Total。</span></td></tr><tr><td data-help-static-en="Daily Review Rating" data-help-static-es="Daily Review Rating">Daily Review Rating</td><td><span class="en">Employee Daily Review rating for that date/period. A dash means no rating is saved.</span><span class="es">Calificación de Daily Review del empleado para esa fecha/periodo. Un guion significa que no hay calificación guardada.</span><span class="zh">员工 Daily Review Rating；显示 “—” 表示没有保存 Rating。</span><span class="zh-tw">員工 Daily Review Rating；顯示 “—” 表示沒有儲存 Rating。</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div></section><section class="section" id="settings"><h2><span class="en">Settings: Provider Chain and Provider Jobs</span><span class="es">Settings: cadena de proveedores y trabajos de proveedor</span><span class="zh">Settings：Provider Chain 与 Provider Jobs</span><span class="zh-tw">Settings：Provider Chain 與 Provider Jobs</span></h2><div class="callout"><span class="en"><b>Language:</b> the Settings page follows the same English / Simplified Chinese / Traditional Chinese / Spanish switch as the rest of the application, including Application Settings, Provider Chain, Provider Jobs, verification controls and Company Website Library.</span><span class="es"><b>Idioma:</b> Settings sigue el mismo selector English / 简体中文 / 繁體中文 / Español que el resto de la aplicación, incluidos Application Settings, Provider Chain, Provider Jobs, controles de verificación y Company Website Library.</span><span class="zh"><b>语言：</b>Settings 页面与系统顶部 English / 简体中文 / 繁體中文 / Español 开关同步，包括页面标题、Application Settings、Provider Chain、Provider Jobs、验证控制、Company Website Library 以及动态扫描/任务内容。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>語言：</b>Settings 頁面與系統頂部 English / 简体中文 / 繁體中文 / Español 開關同步，包括頁面標題、Application Settings、Provider Chain、Provider Jobs、驗證控制、Company Website Library 以及動態掃描/任務內容。</span></div><h3 data-help-static-en="Display Name" data-help-static-es="Nombre mostrado">Display Name</h3><p class="en">Changes the company name shown by the Sales Post Tracker. This is display branding, not a database/account rename.</p><p class="es">Cambia el nombre de empresa mostrado por Sales Post Tracker. Es branding visual, no un cambio de nombre de base de datos/cuenta.</p><p class="zh">修改系统界面显示的公司名称；只是 Display Name，不是数据库或账号重命名。</p><p class="zh-tw">修改系統界面顯示的公司名稱；只是 Display Name，不是資料庫或賬號重命名。</p>
<h3><span class="en">Verification Recovery timeout</span><span class="es">Tiempo de recuperación de verificación</span><span class="zh">Verification Recovery 自动恢复时间</span><span class="zh-tw">Verification Recovery 自動恢復時間</span></h3><p class="en">In <b>Settings → Verification Recovery</b>, Admin can set the hard recovery timeout from <b>5 to 60 minutes</b>. This timeout is only for a verification process whose liveness connection still exists but is stuck. If the process dies or disconnects, the orphan lock is recovered immediately. <b>In Case: Manual Unlock</b> remains the emergency fallback.</p><p class="es">En <b>Settings → Verification Recovery</b>, Admin puede configurar el tiempo de recuperación entre <b>5 y 60 minutos</b>. Solo se usa cuando la conexión de vida del proceso aún existe pero el proceso está bloqueado. Si el proceso termina o se desconecta, el bloqueo huérfano se recupera de inmediato. <b>In Case: Manual Unlock</b> sigue siendo el recurso de emergencia.</p><p class="zh">在 <b>Settings → Verification Recovery</b> 中，Admin 可以把硬性自动恢复时间设置为 <b>5–60 分钟</b>。这个时间只针对“存活连接还在，但验证实际卡死”的情况；如果进程已经死亡或断线，孤儿锁仍会立即自动恢复。<b>兜底：手动解锁</b>继续保留作为紧急处理。</p><p class="zh-tw">在 <b>Settings → Verification Recovery</b> 中，Admin 可以把硬性自動恢復時間設定為 <b>5–60 分鐘</b>。這個時間只針對「存活連線還在，但驗證實際卡死」的情況；如果程序已經死亡或斷線，孤兒鎖仍會立即自動恢復。<b>備用：手動解鎖</b>繼續保留作為緊急處理。</p>
<h3 data-help-static-en="Facebook Marketplace Provider Chain" data-help-static-es="Cadena de proveedores de Facebook Marketplace">Facebook Marketplace Provider Chain</h3><p class="en">Providers are tried from top to bottom. Priority 1 is attempted first; if a provider cannot complete the job, the chain can fall through to the next enabled provider.</p><p class="es">Los proveedores se prueban de arriba abajo. Priority 1 se intenta primero; si un proveedor no puede completar el trabajo, la cadena puede pasar al siguiente proveedor habilitado.</p><p class="zh">Provider 按从上到下的顺序尝试。Priority 1 优先；如果不能完成任务，会继续尝试后续 Enabled Provider。</p><p class="zh-tw">Provider 按從上到下的順序嘗試。Priority 1 優先；如果不能完成任務，會繼續嘗試後續 Enabled Provider。</p>
<div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th data-help-static-en="Item" data-help-static-es="Elemento">Item</th><th data-help-static-en="Meaning / Action" data-help-static-es="Significado / acción">Meaning / Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="⋮⋮ Drag handle" data-help-static-es="⋮⋮ Control de arrastre">⋮⋮ Drag handle</td><td><span class="en">Press and drag the whole provider row. A placeholder shows where it will be inserted; release to save the new order.</span><span class="es">Mantén pulsada y arrastra toda la fila del proveedor. Un marcador muestra dónde se insertará; suelta para guardar el nuevo orden.</span><span class="zh">按住拖动手柄移动整条 Provider；占位区显示松手后的插入位置，松手后保存新顺序。</span><span class="zh-tw">按住拖動手柄移動整條 Provider；佔位區顯示松手後的插入位置，松手後儲存新順序。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Priority" data-help-static-es="Prioridad">Priority</td><td><span class="en">Failover order. Smaller number = tried earlier.</span><span class="es">Orden de failover. Un número menor = se intenta antes.</span><span class="zh">Failover 顺序；数字越小越先尝试。</span><span class="zh-tw">Failover 順序；數字越小越先嘗試。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Tested / Needs test" data-help-static-es="Probado / Requiere prueba">Tested / Needs test</td><td><span class="en">Only providers that pass a real test can be added to the chain.</span><span class="es">Solo los proveedores que superan una prueba real pueden añadirse a la cadena.</span><span class="zh">只有通过真实 Test 的 Provider 才能加入 Chain。</span><span class="zh-tw">只有通過真實 Test 的 Provider 才能加入 Chain。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Token: Stored / None" data-help-static-es="Token: Guardado / Ninguno">Token: Stored / None</td><td><span class="en">Whether a provider credential is stored. The UI does not display the raw secret.</span><span class="es">Indica si hay una credencial de proveedor guardada. La interfaz no muestra el secreto sin procesar.</span><span class="zh">表示是否已保存 Provider Credential；界面不会显示明文 Secret。</span><span class="zh-tw">表示是否已儲存 Provider Credential；界面不會顯示明文 Secret。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Last test" data-help-static-es="Última prueba">Last test</td><td><span class="en">Last Provider test timestamp.</span><span class="es">Marca de tiempo de la última prueba del proveedor.</span><span class="zh">最近一次 Provider Test 时间。</span><span class="zh-tw">最近一次 Provider Test 時間。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Enabled" data-help-static-es="Habilitado">Enabled</td><td><span class="en">Enabled providers participate in failover. Disabled providers remain in the list but are skipped.</span><span class="es">Los proveedores Enabled participan en failover. Los Disabled permanecen en la lista pero se omiten.</span><span class="zh">Enabled 才参与 Failover；Disabled 仍留在列表中但会被跳过。</span><span class="zh-tw">Enabled 才參與 Failover；Disabled 仍留在列表中但會被跳過。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Remove" data-help-static-es="Eliminar">Remove</td><td><span class="en">Removes that provider profile from the active registry/list.</span><span class="es">Elimina ese perfil de proveedor del registro/lista activa.</span><span class="zh">从 Provider Registry/List 中移除该 Provider Profile。</span><span class="zh-tw">從 Provider Registry/List 中移除該 Provider Profile。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="+ Add Provider" data-help-static-es="+ Añadir proveedor">+ Add Provider</td><td><span class="en">Opens Provider setup. Enter provider type/name/credential, run Test Provider, then Add Provider becomes available.</span><span class="es">Abre la configuración del proveedor. Introduce tipo/nombre/credencial, ejecuta Test Provider y después se habilita Add Provider.</span><span class="zh">打开新增 Provider；填写类型、名称、Credential，先 Test Provider，通过后 Add Provider 才可用。</span><span class="zh-tw">打開新增 Provider；填寫類型、名稱、Credential，先 Test Provider，通過後 Add Provider 才可用。</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<div class="callout"><span class="en"><b>Facebook verification classification:</b> provider-specific publish times are normalized into strict internal date fields before verification. An existing listing with no verifiable date becomes <b>DATE_NOT_VERIFIABLE</b>; an explicitly removed/unavailable listing becomes <b>LISTING_UNAVAILABLE</b>; transport/API failures remain <b>FACEBOOK_PROVIDER_FAILED</b>. Unavailable is never inferred from missing metadata alone.</span><span class="es"><b>Clasificación de verificación de Facebook:</b> las fechas específicas del proveedor se normalizan antes de verificar. Un anuncio existente sin fecha verificable se convierte en <b>DATE_NOT_VERIFIABLE</b>; un anuncio explícitamente eliminado/no disponible en <b>LISTING_UNAVAILABLE</b>; los fallos de API/transporte siguen siendo <b>FACEBOOK_PROVIDER_FAILED</b>. Nunca se deduce No disponible solo porque falten metadatos.</span><span class="zh"><b>Facebook 验证分类：</b>Provider 返回的各种发布时间先标准化成严格内部日期，再进入验证。帖子存在但无法确认日期 → <b>DATE_NOT_VERIFIABLE</b>；Provider 明确确认帖子已删除/下架/不可用 → <b>LISTING_UNAVAILABLE</b>；API/网络/Rate Limit 等仍是 <b>FACEBOOK_PROVIDER_FAILED</b>。绝不能只因为缺字段就判断 Unavailable。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Facebook 驗證分類：</b>Provider 返回的各種發布時間先標準化成嚴格內部日期，再進入驗證。貼文存在但無法確認日期 → <b>DATE_NOT_VERIFIABLE</b>；Provider 明確確認貼文已刪除/下架/不可用 → <b>LISTING_UNAVAILABLE</b>；API/網路/Rate Limit 等仍是 <b>FACEBOOK_PROVIDER_FAILED</b>。絕不能只因為缺欄位就判斷 Unavailable。</span></div>
<h3 data-help-static-en="Recent Provider Jobs" data-help-static-es="Trabajos recientes de proveedor">Recent Provider Jobs</h3><p class="en">This is operational tracking for provider tests and live failover attempts.</p><p class="es">Es el seguimiento operativo de pruebas de proveedores e intentos de failover en vivo.</p><p class="zh">这里用于 Tracking Provider Test 和实际 Failover 尝试。</p><p class="zh-tw">這裡用於 Tracking Provider Test 和實際 Failover 嘗試。</p>
<div class="cards"><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="Time filter" data-help-static-es="Filtro de tiempo">Time filter</h4><p data-help-static-en="Last 1 Hour / Last 24 Hours / Last 7 Days / Last 30 Days / All Time" data-help-static-es="Última 1 hora / Últimas 24 horas / Últimos 7 días / Últimos 30 días / Todo el tiempo">Last 1 Hour / Last 24 Hours / Last 7 Days / Last 30 Days / All Time</p></div><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="Pagination" data-help-static-es="Paginación">Pagination</h4><p class="en">8 jobs per page. Previous / Next moves through historical pages.</p><p class="es">8 trabajos por página. Previous / Next recorre páginas históricas.</p><p class="zh">每页 8 条；Previous / Next 查看历史页。</p><p class="zh-tw">每頁 8 條；Previous / Next 查看歷史頁。</p></div><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="Live" data-help-static-es="En vivo">Live</h4><p class="en">The newest page can refresh live. Historical pages are for stable review.</p><p class="es">La página más reciente puede actualizarse en vivo. Las páginas históricas son para revisión estable.</p><p class="zh">最新页可 Live 更新；历史页用于稳定查看。</p><p class="zh-tw">最新頁可 Live 更新；歷史頁用於穩定查看。</p></div><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="Status / HTTP / Error" data-help-static-es="Estado / HTTP / Error">Status / HTTP / Error</h4><p class="en">Use these columns to see whether the provider succeeded, what HTTP status it returned and why it failed.</p><p class="es">Usa estas columnas para ver si el proveedor tuvo éxito, qué estado HTTP devolvió y por qué falló.</p><p class="zh">通过 Status、HTTP、Error 判断 Provider 是否成功以及失败原因。</p><p class="zh-tw">通過 Status、HTTP、Error 判斷 Provider 是否成功以及失敗原因。</p></div></div><div class="callout warn"><span class="en"><b>Craigslist / OfferUp 403 fallback:</b> when direct marketplace retrieval is blocked, the system can try configured Bright Data / Apify fallback before sending the post to Manual Verification. Use Recent Provider Jobs to see provider attempts, HTTP status and errors.</span><span class="es">Fallback de Craigslist / OfferUp 403: cuando se bloquea la recuperación directa del marketplace, el sistema puede intentar Bright Data / Apify configurados antes de enviar la publicación a Verificación manual. Usa Recent Provider Jobs para ver intentos, estado HTTP y errores.</span><span class="zh"><b>Craigslist / OfferUp 403 fallback：</b>当 Marketplace 拒绝服务器直连时，系统会先尝试已配置的 Bright Data / Apify fallback；仍失败才进入 Manual Verification。可在 Recent Provider Jobs 查看 Provider 尝试、HTTP 状态和错误。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Craigslist / OfferUp 403 fallback：</b>當 Marketplace 拒絕服務器直連時，系統會先嘗試已配置的 Bright Data / Apify fallback；仍失敗才進入 Manual Verification。可在 Recent Provider Jobs 查看 Provider 嘗試、HTTP 狀態和錯誤。</span></div></section><section class="section" id="website"><h2><span class="en">Company Website Library: duplicate-source management</span><span class="es">Biblioteca del sitio web de la empresa: gestión de fuentes de duplicados</span><span class="zh">Company Website Library：查重来源管理</span><span class="zh-tw">Company Website Library：重複檢查來源管理</span></h2><p class="en">The Company Website Library supplies additional duplicate-reference records. Sales verification can compare Marketplace content against these references.</p><p class="es">La Biblioteca del sitio web de la empresa aporta registros adicionales de referencia para duplicados. La verificación de Ventas puede comparar el contenido de Marketplace con estas referencias.</p><p class="zh">Company Website Library 是额外的查重数据源；Sales 验证时可拿 Marketplace 内容与这里的 Reference 比较。</p><p class="zh-tw">Company Website Library 是額外的重複檢查數據源；Sales 驗證時可拿 Marketplace 內容與這裡的 Reference 比較。</p>
<div class="numbered"><div><h3 data-help-static-en="1. Website URL" data-help-static-es="1. URL del sitio web">1. Website URL</h3><p class="en">Save the company website host that Admin wants the checker to use.</p><p class="es">Guarda el host del sitio web de la empresa que Admin quiere que use el verificador.</p><p class="zh">先保存要用于查重的公司网站地址。</p><p class="zh-tw">先儲存要用於重複檢查的公司網站地址。</p></div><div><h3 data-help-static-en="2. Website / Sitemap Scan" data-help-static-es="2. Escaneo de sitio web / Sitemap">2. Website / Sitemap Scan</h3><p class="en">Paste a page, site root or sitemap URL on the saved host and click Scan &amp; Import.</p><p class="es">Pega una página, raíz del sitio o URL de sitemap del host guardado y haz clic en Scan &amp; Import.</p><p class="zh">粘贴网页、网站根目录或 Sitemap URL，点击 Scan &amp; Import。</p><p class="zh-tw">粘貼網頁、網站根目錄或 Sitemap URL，點擊 Scan &amp; Import。</p></div><div><h3 data-help-static-en="3. URL CSV" data-help-static-es="3. CSV de URL">3. URL CSV</h3><p class="en">Import URL rows or metadata rows. Download Sample CSV to see the accepted format.</p><p class="es">Importa filas de URL o filas de metadatos. Descarga Sample CSV para ver el formato aceptado.</p><p class="zh">可导入 URL 或带 metadata 的 CSV；用 Download Sample CSV 查看格式。</p><p class="zh-tw">可導入 URL 或帶 metadata 的 CSV；用 Download Sample CSV 查看格式。</p></div><div><h3 data-help-static-en="+ Manual Reference" data-help-static-es="+ Referencia manual">+ Manual Reference</h3><p class="en">Manually enter Page URL, Title, Description and optional Image URL when you do not want to crawl.</p><p class="es">Introduce manualmente Page URL, Title, Description y una Image URL opcional cuando no quieras rastrear el sitio.</p><p class="zh">不想抓网页时，可手工填写 Page URL、Title、Description 和 Image URL。</p><p class="zh-tw">不想抓網頁時，可手工填寫 Page URL、Title、Description 和 Image URL。</p></div></div>
<h3 data-help-static-en="Search / Delete" data-help-static-es="Buscar / Eliminar">Search / Delete</h3><p class="en">Search by URL, title or description. <b>Delete</b> immediately removes the reference from the comparison database.</p><p class="es">Busca por URL, título o descripción. Delete elimina inmediatamente la referencia de la base de datos de comparación.</p><p class="zh">可按 URL、Title、Description 搜索。点击 <b>Delete</b> 会立即从查重数据库删除该 Reference。</p><p class="zh-tw">可按 URL、Title、Description 搜索。點擊 <b>Delete</b> 會立即從重複檢查資料庫刪除該 Reference。</p>
<div class="callout warn"><span class="en"><b>Images pending</b> means image URLs exist but image fingerprints are not yet indexed. Until indexing completes, those images may not participate in image comparison.</span><span class="es">Images pending significa que existen URL de imagen pero sus fingerprints aún no están indexados. Hasta que termine la indexación, esas imágenes pueden no participar en la comparación de imágenes.</span><span class="zh"><b>Images pending</b> 表示已经有 Image URL，但图片指纹还未完成索引；索引完成前这些图片可能还不能参与图片查重。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Images pending</b> 表示已經有 Image URL，但圖片指紋還未完成索引；索引完成前這些圖片可能還不能參與圖片重複檢查。</span></div></section><section class="section" id="tracking"><h2><span class="en">Recommended Admin daily tracking workflow</span><span class="es">Flujo diario recomendado de seguimiento para Admin</span><span class="zh">建议的 Admin 每日 Tracking 流程</span><span class="zh-tw">建議的 Admin 每日 Tracking 流程</span></h2><div class="checklist"><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Open Dashboard and start with 1 Day / today.</span><span class="es">Abre el Panel y comienza con 1 Day / hoy.</span><span class="zh">打开 Dashboard，先看今天的 1 Day。</span><span class="zh-tw">打開 Dashboard，先看今天的 1 Day。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Check each Sales card: post count vs target, Good/Bad/Unreviewed.</span><span class="es">Comprueba cada tarjeta de Ventas: número de publicaciones frente al objetivo, Good/Bad/Unreviewed.</span><span class="zh">逐个 Sales 看发帖数量、目标、Good/Bad/Unreviewed。</span><span class="zh-tw">逐個 Sales 看發帖數量、目標、Good/Bad/Unreviewed。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Open Sales with Unreviewed posts and perform Post Review.</span><span class="es">Abre los vendedores con publicaciones Unreviewed y realiza Post Review.</span><span class="zh">优先打开有 Unreviewed 的 Sales，完成 Post Review。</span><span class="zh-tw">優先打開有 Unreviewed 的 Sales，完成 Post Review。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Use Refresh Content only when the live listing changed or the saved content is stale.</span><span class="es">Usa Refresh Content solo cuando el anuncio en vivo haya cambiado o el contenido guardado esté desactualizado.</span><span class="zh">只有原帖变化或保存内容过旧时才使用 Refresh Content。</span><span class="zh-tw">只有原帖變化或儲存內容過舊時才使用 Refresh Content。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Complete Daily Review separately when an employee-level rating/note is required.</span><span class="es">Completa Daily Review por separado cuando se requiera una calificación/nota a nivel de empleado.</span><span class="zh">需要员工级评价时，单独完成 Daily Review。</span><span class="zh-tw">需要員工級評價時，單獨完成 Daily Review。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Check Information Center for deletion requests.</span><span class="es">Comprueba Information Center para solicitudes de eliminación.</span><span class="zh">查看 Information Center 的删除申请。</span><span class="zh-tw">查看 Information Center 的刪除申請。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Use Reports for date/team comparisons and download CSV when management needs a record.</span><span class="es">Usa Reports para comparaciones de fechas/equipos y descarga CSV cuando la dirección necesite un registro.</span><span class="zh">需要跨日期/团队比较时用 Reports，管理留档时下载 CSV。</span><span class="zh-tw">需要跨日期/團隊比較時用 Reports，管理留檔時下載 CSV。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">If verification starts failing, check Settings → Recent Provider Jobs before changing Provider configuration.</span><span class="es">Si la verificación empieza a fallar, comprueba Settings → Recent Provider Jobs antes de cambiar la configuración de proveedores.</span><span class="zh">如果验证开始失败，先看 Settings → Recent Provider Jobs，再决定是否改 Provider 配置。</span><span class="zh-tw">如果驗證開始失敗，先看 Settings → Recent Provider Jobs，再決定是否改 Provider 配置。</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="safety"><h2><span class="en">Important Admin rules</span><span class="es">Reglas importantes de Admin</span><span class="zh">Admin 重要操作规则</span><span class="zh-tw">Admin 重要操作規则</span></h2><div class="callout danger"><span class="en"><b>Delete Post / Approve &amp; Delete is permanent.</b> Do not use it as a temporary hide/archive function.</span><span class="es">Delete Post / Approve &amp; Delete es permanente. No lo uses como función temporal de ocultar/archivar.</span><span class="zh"><b>Delete Post / Approve &amp; Delete 是永久删除。</b>不要把它当成临时隐藏或 Archive。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Delete Post / Approve &amp; Delete 是永久刪除。</b>不要把它當成臨時隱藏或 Archive。</span></div>
<div class="callout warn"><span class="en"><b>Provider tokens are sensitive.</b> Settings shows whether a token is stored, not the raw value. Do not copy secrets into notes, screenshots or support messages.</span><span class="es">Los tokens de proveedor son sensibles. Settings muestra si hay un token guardado, no el valor sin procesar. No copies secretos en notas, capturas de pantalla ni mensajes de soporte.</span><span class="zh"><b>Provider Token 属于敏感信息。</b>Settings 只显示 Stored/None，不应把明文 Token 放进 Note、截图或支持消息。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Provider Token 屬於敏感信息。</b>Settings 只顯示 Stored/None，不應把明文 Token 放進 Note、截圖或支持消息。</span></div>
<div class="callout"><span class="en"><b>Good/Bad ≠ Daily Review Rating.</b> Post quality metrics and employee performance ratings must remain separate.</span><span class="es">Good/Bad ≠ Daily Review Rating. Las métricas de calidad de publicaciones y las calificaciones de rendimiento del empleado deben mantenerse separadas.</span><span class="zh"><b>Good/Bad ≠ Daily Review Rating。</b>帖子质量与员工绩效必须分开评价。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Good/Bad ≠ Daily Review Rating。</b>貼文質量與員工績效必須分開評價。</span></div>
<div class="callout"><span class="en"><b>Disabled provider ≠ deleted provider.</b> Disabled keeps the provider in the chain configuration but skips it during failover; Remove deletes the profile from the list.</span><span class="es">Disabled provider ≠ deleted provider. Disabled conserva el proveedor en la configuración de la cadena pero lo omite durante failover; Remove elimina el perfil de la lista.</span><span class="zh"><b>Disabled ≠ Remove。</b>Disabled 保留配置但 Failover 时跳过；Remove 是从列表中移除 Provider Profile。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Disabled ≠ Remove。</b>Disabled 保留配置但 Failover 時跳過；Remove 是從列表中移除 Provider Profile。</span></div></section><div class="footer"><span class="en">CoolerDepot Sales Post Tracker • V<?= htmlspecialchars((string)$helpVersion, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8') ?> • In-app training guide</span><span class="es">CoolerDepot Sales Post Tracker • V<?= htmlspecialchars((string)$helpVersion, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8') ?> • Guía integrada</span><span class="zh">CoolerDepot Sales Post Tracker • V<?= htmlspecialchars((string)$helpVersion, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8') ?> • 系统内使用说明</span><span class="zh-tw">CoolerDepot Sales Post Tracker • V<?= htmlspecialchars((string)$helpVersion, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8') ?> • 系統內使用說明</span></div></div>
